Lucky Lode Node — attribution and licensing notice
==================================================

This repository is the consensus node of the Lucky Lode project. It is a
fork of VerusCoin v1.2.18, which derives from Komodo and Zcash, which
derive from Bitcoin Core. Their copyright and license notices are
retained verbatim in COPYING and in the source headers; attribution for
vendored components (BLAKE3, the Argon2 reference implementation,
libsodium, and others) remains in their directories under src/.

