Upstream attribution
--------------------

The Verus, Komodo, Zcash, and Bitcoin Core developers' notices are kept
unaltered. Lucky Lode's changes to this codebase include the LuckyHash
proof-of-work and its KAT gates, the Lucky Pot and pre-committable draw
rules, hybrid PoS adjustments, Lucky Lode chain parameters, datadirs,
ports, and naming, and the LuckyBridge (upstream "PBaaS") user-facing
strings.

Contact: the Lucky Lode project — https://luckylode.cc
